<h2 class="g-h2" id="behaviour">Behaviour</h2>
<div class="g-prose"><p>At most three show; a fourth retires the oldest. A toast pauses while the pointer or focus is on it and resumes after. Each has a named dismiss button.</p></div>

<h2 class="g-h2" id="accessibility">Accessibility</h2>
<div class="g-prose"><p>The stack is a polite live region, so a toast is announced without taking focus. Because a toast leaves, put anything the reader needs to recover from an error in the page as well.</p></div>

